/-! ## (G) THE CAPSTONE — welded, non-hollow. -/

/-- ★★★ THE PER-CHANNEL DEPTH DRESSING (arc-D D2c, welded landing). The banked census-in-census depth
    dressing (D3/Z5) composed into the recombination weld (D2b) PER CHANNEL, each channel carrying its
